        "audio": "code/audio/segments/island-01-work-core-4-q-es.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "question"
      },
      {
        "text": "Most days I'm on calls with customers, doing demos, helping people test the software, and helping build the technical case for why they should buy and use our software to solve their problems.",
        "audio": "code/audio/segments/island-01-work-core-4-a-en-s01.mp3",
