        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "AI can help with the data but I have to tell the story.",
        "audio": "code/audio/segments/island-01-work-deeper-2-a-en-s03.mp3",
        "lang": "en",
        "role": "answer"
      },
      {
        "text": "La IA puede ayudar con los datos, pero la historia la tengo que contar yo.",
        "audio": "code/audio/segments/island-01-work-deeper-2-a-es-s03.mp3",
        "lang": "es",
        "role": "answer"
      }
    ]
